  ⚠ svelte(no-bind-value-on-checkable-inputs): `bind:value` does not work on checkbox inputs.
   ╭─[no_bind_value_on_checkable_inputs.tsx:1:24]
 1 │ <input type="checkbox" bind:value={agreed} />
   ·                        ───────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Use `bind:checked` for a single checkbox, or `bind:group` for a set of them.

  ⚠ svelte(no-bind-value-on-checkable-inputs): `bind:value` does not work on radio inputs.
   ╭─[no_bind_value_on_checkable_inputs.tsx:1:21]
 1 │ <input type="radio" bind:value={choice} />
   ·                     ───────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Use `bind:group` to bind the selected radio of a group.

